New battles use candidate90 cognition by default on the normal battlefield. Launch
`scripts/launch.sh` normally; `-ArmyTrenches` selects Trenches. `-ArmyLegacy` selects
the legacy AI. The CLI defaults to cognition; use `--legacy-ai`, `--foundations`, or
